        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Whisper Dictation replaces the keyboard's dictation key with [whisper.cpp](https://github.com/ggerganov/whisper.cpp), transcribing everything **on-device**. Your audio never leaves the phone.\n\n- Tap the mic key to start, tap again to insert the transcript.\n- Pick the Whisper model that fits your phone, from Tiny (75 MB) to Medium (1.5 GB). Models download from Settings and switching takes effect immediately.\n- Optional spoken punctuation turns \"comma\", \"period\" and \"question mark\" into the real marks.\n- Works in apps that never asked for microphone access.\n- Choose which apps use it under Settings → Whisper Dictation → Enabled Apps.",
          "useSpacing": true
